ion":{"commit_sha":"51fe15617fcd8d149b0c493848d2f60dddde36ad","position":"1787005043674148001-97c9c135-ef4c-4b88-b5e4-dd9a10dd20aa"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2a905e2178bd905ac573602173fde4b2c279c1a9f9c9ac12c57af81c91a7bb17","event_uuid":"18195676-7ed7-4f68-afcc-24a16f2446d4","position":{"commit_sha":"f85ff6400c44c79bfc73b5d95cc317c79f7ad47f","position":"1787005178849008001-18195676-7ed7-4f68-afcc-24a16f2446d4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RP-04 execution kickoff. Worktree: /Users/joeoakhart/rebar-rp04 branch rp04-impl on origin/main (229505775a). Landing method: rebar/Gerrit default — push to refs/for/main, LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1 gate every change, stacked relation-chain in dependency order, submit top to land. Plan-review claim gate ENABLED; completion-verifier close gate assumed enabled. Tree: epic e215 (RP-04) with 7 story leaves. Dependency/stack order: S1 a377 -> {S2 e042, S4 bbdc, S6 6f14} -> {S3 6e3b(needs S2), S5 5851(needs S4)} -> S7 aabf(needs S3,S5,S6). All stories have recorded file_impact (code leaves). Epic blocker 23e9 (ADR 0098) already closed.","timestamp":1787002906158290001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Epic e215 plan-review PASSED (certified at 229505775a, currency_basis=file_impact). Claimed epic e215 open->in_progress (joeoakhart@navapbc.com). Starting S1 a377 (foundation). Running plan-review on S1 next.","timestamp":1787003281542862001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"OPERATOR DIRECTIVE (user): epic AC10 [operator-attested] is a hard gate — the AWS code-review bot (Gerrit LLM-Review) AND the GitHub Actions CI reconciler (Verified) must both run green on the NEW code without error/credential-leak/unauthorized-fallback. Record run/change IDs, timestamps, selected provider/auth-source kind, retry counts, redacted outcomes as epic comments before closing the epic. In the Gerrit default this is exercised per change: LLM-Review+1 = review bot on new code, Verified+1 = GitHub Actions CI on new code. Will capture canary evidence as the stack lands.","timestamp":1787003306274958001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 RED confirmed: both new oracles fail with ModuleNotFoundError rebar._operation_config (genuine absence, not typo). Held-out oracle stashed to session files/heldout-s1/. E2E surfaces file removed from worktree entirely; unit file about to be trimmed to happy-path-only for the implementer.","timestamp":1787003680920479001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 held-out validation: full oracle 32/32 GREEN against unchanged implementation. 5 initial failures were TEST DEFECTS (parent-dir helper, over-specified 'Error:' prefix, global subprocess.run patch breaking isolation harness, sentinel-in-exception-message) — fixed keeping teeth, implementation untouched. Mutation teeth: broke cli_overrides->precedence RED; no-op secret validation->rejection RED; freeze->plain-dict->immutability RED; all restored GREEN. Preflight: make lint exit0 (complexity new=0 increased=0), make typecheck exit0 (556 files), AC suites 85/86 (the 1 = env-only sandbox GIT_CONFIG safe.bareRepository=explicit; reproduces on pristine origin/main, passes 4/4 with override neutralized). Threaded surfaces smoke 47/47.","timestamp":1787005043674148001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 (a377) committed c006f54 (Change-Id I53c1203..., rebar-ticket a377 resolves OK, DCO signed) and PUSHED to Gerrit change 1841: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1841 . Gates now running on NEW code: LLM-Review (AWS review bot) + Verified (GitHub Actions CI) = the AC10 operator canary. Local preflight was fully green (lint/typecheck/oracle). Continuing to implement S2 e042 stacked on top while S1 gates run.","timestamp":1787005178849008001}],"created_at":1787002884362962001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2646a7d8-e632-4cc7-8364-5da0de16e23b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e215-ab23-ed6a-4791"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","e215-ab23-ed6a-4791"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"77c0-9fe4-e0eb-4073","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement vibrant-legal-hind (RP-04): Operation-scoped configuration and provider-auth composition","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fe6b4c00-5230-4850-80a3-35a813862929","2646a7d8-e632-4cc7-8364-5da0de16e23b","4c2d608b-e9af-418e-811d-422088453aeb","edda1ee6-d8d7-46d3-8c5c-1ddf93cd4764","0a9ffb6f-3d91-4cd0-9c8d-0063d53b77d7","39858806-5618-4a1c-b14d-c3bc8b98aedb","97c9c135-ef4c-4b88-b5e4-dd9a10dd20aa","18195676-7ed7-4f68-afcc-24a16f2446d4